xpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1429029-rules-question-linking-compel-with-intimidate?p=1429032#post1429032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I meant as a way to expand the dice pool involved.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> in that case look with puppy eyes to your ST","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","user":"archderd","date":". 12-19-2020, 01:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","name":"archderd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T13:51:04-08:00","id":1429058,"title":"","content":"I dont quite get why you would need to get Intimidate into the mix ^^&quot; (you mean the skill, right?) IIRC thats already part of Charisma","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T20:43:32-08:00","id":1429111,"title":"","content":"I was hoping something like (&quot;sit down and shut up&quot;) Intimidate + Dominate or even Intimidate + Dominate + Charisma was possible. But it isn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T06:00:38-08:00","id":1429343,"title":"","content":"I know what you mean but (I looked it up) thats actually is part of Charisma... though luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T06:47:51-08:00","id":1429499,"title":"","content":"Declare action. &quot;I will use a Dominate compel to intimidate them to shut up and sit.&quot;<br /> Different kind of solutions.<br /> 1) You roll for Compell and your victim will now sit and shut up. They are now in a weaker position and your ST might award you the successess in bonus dice in your intimidate action which follows.<br /> 2) You level of Dominate functions as a quality tool in the Intimidation process. Either just dots in Dominate as extra dice or your ST does not want two rolls and just declares that all your dots in Dominate add to the Successess, when have rolled at least 1 Success in your Intimidation roll.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-na